      "cooked": "<p>I am facing a <strong>500 Internal Server Error</strong> when trying to generate <strong>PDF output for a Print Designer print format</strong> in ERPNext v15.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The issue occurs <strong>only for PDF generation of Print Designer print format</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>HTML/Jinja print formats generate PDFs without any issue</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493055-environment-details-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493055-environment-details-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Environment Details</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>ERPNext Version</strong>: v15</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Frappe Version</strong>: v15 (bundled with ERPNext)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Deployment</strong>: VPS (Ubuntu 24.04)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Web Server</strong>: Nginx 1.24.0</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>PDF Engine</strong>: wkhtmltopdf (installed and working for other formats)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493055-error-details-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493055-error-details-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Error Details</h2>\n<p>When clicking Print for a sales invoice or purchase invoice item I face the below errors, the following request fails:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 124854\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0_2_660x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 124854\" data-base62-sha1=\"td8IIicjKRUcLVCd0ZCUDbmIBEI\" width=\"660\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0_2_660x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0_2_990x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/ccbb503ea6afbaa410ddea196c13a5f83f4b05d0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-02-01 124854</span><span class=\"informations\">1211×917 46.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/b/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 125006\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04_2_690x335.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 125006\" data-base62-sha1=\"mbF5IBI3KHs8GcQI5RPccGAPNwo\" width=\"690\" height=\"335\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04_2_690x335.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04_2_1035x502.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/b/9b815403114c4541e440fe58962658cd126d7e04_2_1380x670.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2E2E32\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-02-01 125006</span><span class=\"informations\">1734×842 99.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>During <strong>PDF generation for Print Designer formats</strong>, the browser requests images using <strong>port 8000</strong>, for example:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com:8000/public/files/desaitechlogo.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com:8000/public/files/desaitechlogo.jpg</a> <a href=\"https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com:8000/files/signature.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com:8000/files/signature.png</a></p>\n<p>The <strong>same images are accessible without port 8000</strong>, for example:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com/public/files/desaitechlogo.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com/public/files/desaitechlogo.jpg</a> <a href=\"https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com/files/signature.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erpvps.desaitechindia.com/files/signature.png</a></p>\n<p>This behavior is observed <strong>only during PDF generation</strong> for Print Designer formats.<br>\nHTML preview and Jinja/HTML print formats do not show this issue.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 125657\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992_2_690x379.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-01 125657\" data-base62-sha1=\"xVvB2vbKA6fJOXUBl2IUOvvf4H0\" width=\"690\" height=\"379\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992_2_690x379.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992_2_1035x568.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/edc7f8b32ff1388c70d6265f09c94f58c83fc992_2_1380x758.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2C2C30\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-02-01 125657</span><span class=\"informations\">1513×833 68 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-493055-h-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493055-h-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a></h3>\n<p>The error occurs only for Print Designer formats.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493055-h-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493055-h-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a></h2>\n<hr>\n<h2><a name=\"p-493055-what-i-have-already-tried-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493055-what-i-have-already-tried-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>What I Have Already Tried</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Restarted bench and services</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Verified wkhtmltopdf installation</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cleared cache and rebuilt assets</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tested multiple Print Designer formats</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Confirmed file and image URLs are accessible</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>None of the above resolved the issue.</p>",
